   "label": "Hours",
   "precision": "2",
   "description": "How long this worker gave this task on this date. Arrives filled with the standard hours for that date, so an ordinary day needs no typing; type the real time only when the day was shared with another task.\n\nMeasurement only \u2014 pay stays quantity \u00d7 rate, so a mistyped hour spoils a figure and never a wage. Empty reads as a full day, which is what every row recorded before this field existed means."
  },
