   "fieldname": "note",
   "fieldtype": "Small Text",
   "label": "Note",
   "description": "What happened on this worker's day, in their own row: \"sent home 11am, rain\", \"machine down\". Optional, and read later wherever this row is \u2014 the review sheet's daily log, the Worker Task Day report and the Excel export. Editable while the day is unpaid."
